# Cursor Agent Rule
- Always read and follow `AGENTS.md` before analyzing requirements or writing test code.
- Task planning and progress MUST be tracked inside `OUTPUT/<task-slug>/00_plan.md`.
- NEVER create `TODO.md` or clutter the root directory with ad-hoc plan files.
- To view available tasks and blockers, run `npm run status`.
